---
import DesktopWindow from '../DesktopWindow.astro';
---

<DesktopWindow name="notepad" title="About Me - Notepad" icon="/images/icons/notepad_icon.png" closeLabel="Cerrar Bloc de notas" draggable class="h-[min(480px,calc(100vh-4rem))] w-[min(760px,95vw)] z-40 font-mono">
  <div class="shrink-0 bg-black text-gray-300 text-[11px] px-2 py-1 flex space-x-4 border-b border-red-900/50 select-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="px-1">File</span>
    <span class="px-1">Edit</span>
    <span class="px-1">Format</span>
    <span class="px-1">View</span>
    <span class="px-1">Help</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-1 bg-black text-gray-300 p-4 text-xs md:text-sm overflow-y-auto selection:bg-green-800 selection:text-white leading-relaxed font-sans">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-6">
      <div class="sm:w-[68%] text-justify break-words space-y-4">
        <p>From a young age, I've been spending my time on the internet and enjoying videogames. That passion naturally evolved into an interest for software development finally turning into a Software Engineer.</p>
        <p>This is my personal corner of the internet where I'll keep adding stuff that I like. Feel free to use this portfolio as inspiration for your own work.</p>
        <p>Check <a href="/portfolio" class="red-text red-text-fast underline decoration-red-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-1 focus-visible:outline-red-500">My software engineer Portfolio here.</a></p>
        <section aria-labelledby="sw-hw-title" class="rainbow-text text-left pt-4">
          <h2 id="sw-hw-title" class="font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-3">=== SOFTWARE &amp; HARDWARE ===</h2>
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-1">Personal Laptop (Acer Nitro V15)</p>
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1 mb-3">
            <dt class="font-bold text-gray-200">Processor:</dt>
            <dd class="mb-2 sm:mb-0">13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13620H (2.40 GHz)</dd>
            <dt class="font-bold text-gray-200">Installed RAM:</dt>
            <dd class="mb-2 sm:mb-0">16.0 GB (15.7 GB usable)</dd>
            <dt class="font-bold text-gray-200">Graphics card:</dt>
            <dd class="mb-2 sm:mb-0">NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 Laptop GPU (6 GB) / Intel(R) UHD Graphics (128 MB)</dd>
          </dl>
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1 mb-3">
            <dt class="font-bold text-gray-200">Work Device:</dt>
            <dd>Currently using Virtual Boxes with different linux distros, <span class="font-mono text-xs italic text-gray-500">but in the future a Lenovo machine that runs linux really well.</span></dd>
          </dl>
        </section>
      </div>
      <!-- En móvil la imagen queda arriba del texto -->
      <figure class="order-first sm:order-last sm:w-[32%] shrink-0 self-start mx-auto w-48 sm:mx-0 border border-gray-600 shadow-lg">
        <img src="/images/brand/avatar.jpeg" alt="Santiago Sánchez Márquez" width="240" height="240" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover block" />          </figure>
    </div>

    <p class="text-gray-500 mt-6 text-xs font-mono">[ End of file - Read Only Mode ]</p>
  </div>
</DesktopWindow>
